+Provenance is a separate claim. A link is labeled `created here` only for the one lifetime identified by this process's creation proxy, with endpoint serials matching the request, observed in `active` or `paused`, and captured while the request was pending. A matching port pair alone, a replacement under a reused id, or a link first appearing after the request resolved cannot establish provenance. All other links are `observed`.
 
